CommandCodeBridge

The C ABI adapter (cmd/commandcodebridge/main.go), SSE completion aggregation
(internal/bridge/sse.go), session reassignment (internal/bridge/affinity.go),
and CPA browser login compatibility code and its tests
are adapted from ClinePassBridge by xiao-qiu-qiu, commit
7ac0d011fc26c821f27369c0c442f47057a81e8e, licensed under the MIT License.
The original copyright and license are retained in LICENSE.

CommandCodeBridge is an independent integration, not an official CommandCode product.

Release shared libraries embed a modified CPA-Manager-Plus management panel
from https://github.com/seakee/CPA-Manager-Plus (source baseline
recorded in BUILD.json compatibility.cpamp_source_commit). The upstream license and copyrights
are included as LICENSE-CPAMP in native and frontend release archives.

The console's request-log layout is inspired by ClinePassBridge.
The Command Code icon is sourced from the official website:
https://commandcode.ai/favicon/2024/safari-pinned-tab.svg
Command Code brand artwork belongs to its respective owner and is not
covered by this project's MIT license.

The console palette and sidebar layout reference Command Code Studio.
Navigation artwork is sourced from the official site (usage, API key,
taste, billing, and sidebar icons). These brand assets belong to their
respective owner and are not covered by this project's MIT license.
